^rukx  A Turing machine.  Tape is a list of 0/1; the head is an index; state is a number.
^rukx  Unbounded tape + while + a finite table of transitions is Turing-complete.
^rukx  This machine adds two unary numbers: 1^m 0 1^n  becomes  1^{m+n}.
^rukx  1 1 1 0 1 1  (3 + 2)  →  five 1s.

